{"seq":2,"slug":"chain-growth-polymerization","title":"链式聚合（自由基与离子）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/polymerization/chain-growth-polymerization","wordCount":1424,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"链式聚合-自由基与离子\">链式聚合（自由基与离子）</h1><p>往装满苯乙烯的瓶子里滴一点过氧化物引发剂、稍微加热，几分钟内就能取出一团已是高分子量的聚苯乙烯——尽管大部分苯乙烯单体还没反应。这正是链式聚合区别于<a href=\"step-growth-polymerization\">逐步聚合</a>的标志：分子量不是缓慢累积，而是单条链在活性中心上瞬间长成，体系里始终只有「已长成的高分子」和「未碰过的单体」两类物种并存。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>链式聚合需要一个<strong>活性中心</strong>——一个带未配对电子的自由基，或一个带电荷的离子——它逐个吞入单体并把活性传递给新加上的末端，如此反复直至失活。整个过程由四个基元步骤构成：引发（产生活性中心）、增长（单体逐个加成）、终止（活性中心湮灭）、链转移（活性转移到另一分子）。活性中心的化学本性决定了亚类：自由基聚合、阳离子聚合、阴离子聚合，三者在适用单体、对杂质敏感度与可控性上差异巨大。</p>\n<p>下图给出自由基链式聚合的四步骨架：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[引发剂受热/光&lt;br/&gt;分解产生自由基] --&gt; B[引发&lt;br/&gt;R· + M → RM·]&#10;  B --&gt; C[增长&lt;br/&gt;RMn· + M → RMn+1·]&#10;  C --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D[终止&lt;br/&gt;偶合 或 歧化]&#10;  C --&gt; E[链转移&lt;br/&gt;活性转移到 M/S/P]&#10;  E --&gt; C&#10;  D --&gt; F[死高分子链]\">flowchart TD\n  A[引发剂受热/光&lt;br/&gt;分解产生自由基] --&gt; B[引发&lt;br/&gt;R· + M → RM·]\n  B --&gt; C[增长&lt;br/&gt;RMn· + M → RMn+1·]\n  C --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D[终止&lt;br/&gt;偶合 或 歧化]\n  C --&gt; E[链转移&lt;br/&gt;活性转移到 M/S/P]\n  E --&gt; C\n  D --&gt; F[死高分子链]</pre><p>三类链式聚合的对照如下表（可控版本见<a href=\"copolymerization-controlled-radical\">共聚与可控自由基聚合</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>自由基聚合</th>\n<th>阴离子聚合</th>\n<th>阳离子聚合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>活性中心</td>\n<td>自由基</td>\n<td>碳负离子</td>\n<td>碳正离子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用单体</td>\n<td>多数烯类</td>\n<td>缺电子烯（苯乙烯、丁二烯）</td>\n<td>富电子烯（异丁烯、乙烯基醚）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对杂质/水</td>\n<td>较耐受</td>\n<td>极敏感</td>\n<td>极敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>终止</td>\n<td>双基终止难避免</td>\n<td>可无终止（活性聚合）</td>\n<td>易链转移终止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分散度</td>\n<td>1.5–2+</td>\n<td>可 &lt;1.1</td>\n<td>通常较宽</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自由基聚合-动力学与稳态假设\">自由基聚合：动力学与稳态假设</h2><p>自由基聚合是工业产量最大的链式聚合，PE、PVC、PS、PMMA、丙烯酸酯多由它制得。其动力学核心是<strong>稳态假设</strong>：自由基生成速率等于消亡速率，自由基浓度恒定。由此推出聚合总速率：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>d</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_p = k_p [M] \\left(\\frac{f k_d [I]}{k_t}\\right)^{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6779em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意速率正比于引发剂浓度的<strong>半次方</strong>——这是双基终止（两个自由基相遇而湮灭）的数学标志。数均聚合度则由增长与终止/转移的竞争决定，用<strong>动力学链长</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 描述。一个反直觉但重要的结论：提高引发剂浓度虽加快聚合速率，却同时缩短链长、降低分子量，因为更多活性中心意味着更频繁的终止。这种本征的双基终止使普通自由基聚合的分散度难低于 1.5，正是<a href=\"copolymerization-controlled-radical\">可控自由基聚合</a>要攻克的瓶颈。</p>\n<h2 id=\"链转移与自动加速效应\">链转移与自动加速效应</h2><p>两个看似次要的现象深刻影响实际聚合。<strong>链转移</strong>指活性自由基把活性交给另一分子（单体、溶剂、已生成的高分子或专门的链转移剂），自身变成死链——它在不改变聚合速率的情况下降低分子量，工业上常用硫醇作链转移剂来「调钝」分子量。<strong>自动加速效应</strong>（凝胶效应、Trommsdorff 效应）则相反：随转化率升高，体系黏度剧增使大自由基扩散变慢、双基终止受阻，自由基浓度堆积，速率与分子量同时暴涨，甚至引发暴聚失控。本体聚合放热集中时尤须警惕，这关乎熔体黏度随分子量的陡变，见<a href=\"../structure-property/mechanical-rheological-properties\">力学与流变性能</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离子聚合与活性聚合\">离子聚合与活性聚合</h2><p>离子聚合用离子而非自由基作活性中心，因而能做自由基做不到的事。<strong>阴离子聚合</strong>在严格无水无氧、无可使碳负离子失活的杂质时，可实现<strong>活性聚合</strong>（living polymerization）——没有本征终止步骤，所有链几乎同时引发、同步增长，得到极窄分布（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\DJ</mtext></mstyle><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{\\DJ}&lt;1.1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\DJ</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.1</span></span></span></span></span>）和精确可控的分子量，还能在单体耗尽后续加第二种单体合成嵌段共聚物。这一「活性」理念是现代精密合成的源头，后来被移植到自由基体系才有了 ATRP 与 RAFT。<strong>阳离子聚合</strong>适合富电子单体（异丁烯、乙烯基醚），但链转移与终止难控，分布通常较宽。</p>\n<h2 id=\"立构规整性与配位聚合\">立构规整性与配位聚合</h2><p>链式聚合还能控制链上取代基的空间排布即<strong>立构规整性</strong>（tacticity）：全同（isotactic）、间同（syndiotactic）、无规（atactic）。普通自由基聚合得到的多是无规链，难结晶；而 Ziegler–Natta 催化剂与茂金属催化剂通过<strong>配位聚合</strong>能精确控制立构，造出高度全同、可结晶、力学优异的等规聚丙烯。立构规整性是否能让链规整排列、进而结晶，直接连接到<a href=\"../structure-property/polymer-physical-states\">高分子物理态</a>对结晶能力的讨论，也是聚烯烃成为通用工程材料的关键，见<a href=\"../applications-frontiers/engineering-plastics-rubber-fiber\">工程塑料、橡胶与纤维</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>下图汇总链式聚合的脉络：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[链式聚合] --&gt; B[自由基&lt;br/&gt;Rp ∝ I^0.5]&#10;  A --&gt; C[离子聚合]&#10;  C --&gt; D[阴离子活性聚合&lt;br/&gt;窄分布/嵌段]&#10;  C --&gt; E[阳离子&lt;br/&gt;富电子单体]&#10;  B --&gt; F[链转移/自动加速]&#10;  A --&gt; G[配位聚合]&#10;  G --&gt; H[立构规整性&lt;br/&gt;→ 结晶]\">flowchart TD\n  A[链式聚合] --&gt; B[自由基&lt;br/&gt;Rp ∝ I^0.5]\n  A --&gt; C[离子聚合]\n  C --&gt; D[阴离子活性聚合&lt;br/&gt;窄分布/嵌段]\n  C --&gt; E[阳离子&lt;br/&gt;富电子单体]\n  B --&gt; F[链转移/自动加速]\n  A --&gt; G[配位聚合]\n  G --&gt; H[立构规整性&lt;br/&gt;→ 结晶]</pre><ul>\n<li>链式聚合靠活性中心逐个吞入单体，单链瞬间长大，体系中高分子与单体始终并存。</li>\n<li>自由基聚合经引发-增长-终止-链转移四步；稳态下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>∝</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>I</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_p \\propto [I]^{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，双基终止是分散度难降的根源。</li>\n<li>链转移调控分子量；自动加速效应可致速率与分子量暴涨甚至暴聚失控。</li>\n<li>离子聚合（尤其阴离子）可实现无终止的<strong>活性聚合</strong>，得窄分布与嵌段共聚物，是可控聚合之源。</li>\n<li>配位聚合控制<strong>立构规整性</strong>，决定能否结晶（见<a href=\"../structure-property/polymer-physical-states\">物理态</a>）；精密可控版本见<a href=\"copolymerization-controlled-radical\">下一篇</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"链式聚合（自由基与离子）","id":"链式聚合-自由基与离子"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自由基聚合：动力学与稳态假设","id":"自由基聚合-动力学与稳态假设"},{"level":2,"text":"链转移与自动加速效应","id":"链转移与自动加速效应"},{"level":2,"text":"离子聚合与活性聚合","id":"离子聚合与活性聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"立构规整性与配位聚合","id":"立构规整性与配位聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"逐步聚合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/polymerization/step-growth-polymerization"},"next":{"title":"共聚与可控/活性自由基聚合（ATRP·RAFT）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/polymer-chemistry/polymerization/copolymerization-controlled-radical"}}